vitz</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Rottensteiner</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The biochemistry of oleate induction: transcriptional upregulation and peroxisome proliferation</article-title><source>Biochim Biophys Acta</source><year>2006</year><volume>1763</volume><fpage>1392</fpage><lpage>1402</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.bbamcr.2006.07.011</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Gurvitz A, Rottensteiner H (2006) The biochemistry of oleate induction: transcriptional upregulation and peroxisome proliferation. Biochim Biophys Acta 1763:1392&#x02013;1402 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16949166</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR5"><label>5.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Katic</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Khan</surname><given-names>CR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The role of insulin and IGF-1 signaling in longevity</article-title><source>Cell Mol Life Sci</source><year>2005</year><volume>62</volume><fpage>320</fpage><lpage>343</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00018-004-4297-y</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Katic M, Khan CR (2005) The role of insulin and IGF-1 signaling in longevity. Cell Mol Life Sci 62:320&#x02013;343 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15723168</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR6"><label>6.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kruglyak</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The road to genome-wide association studies</article-title><source>Nat Rev Genet</source><year>2008</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>314</fpage><lpage>318</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/nrg2316</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Kruglyak L (2008) The road to genome-wide association studies